<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DuPont started as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DuPont started as hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities said it initiated coverage of DuPont Co as a hold.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- DuPont lost 1/4 to 107-7/8.</p>
</text>
